    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present this extended and renovated 3-bedroom, 1.5-bathroom end-of-terrace home to the market. This property is in showhouse condition and is superbly located in a mature and much-loved coastal neighbourhood. \n\nThis property further benefits with great potential for a viable 2 storey extension to side (subj to PP). Proposed architect drawings can be made available on request.\n\nApprox. 109 m² existing with potential to extend to approx. 158 m² (subj to PP). \n\nSet on a quiet road the property offers unrivalled convenience with shops, supermarket, medical centre, church, cafés, restaurants and bars all within a short stroll. Families will appreciate the range of local schools close by, while commuters benefit from excellent public transport links with both bus and DART services right on the doorstep. The scenic coastal walk and cycleway, as well as Sutton Cross and Howth, are just minutes away. This is a location that truly has it all.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises entrance hallway with cloakroom, a spacious livingroom and a bright extended kitchen/diningroom area opening out to the south facing rear garden. The ground floor further benefits from a convenient utility room and guest WC in the extension too. Upstairs there are 3 bedrooms and a modern shower room. \n\nThe property also enjoys a gated side entrance and a low-maintenance, private, sunny south facing rear garden. The rear garden has the added convenient direct access to your garage to the rear which features an up and over garage door to the outer courtyard. \nSet in a vibrant community, Bayside is often described as Dublin's best kept secret. This home offers a lifestyle that is hard to match. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.4m x 2.0m\nTiled entrance hallway featuring a generous cloakroom.\n\nLiving Room - 5.0m x 5.0m\nSpacious living room featuring a large front picture window and TV point. Finished with hard wood flooring and recess lighting.\n\nKitchen/DiningRoom - 6.1m x 4.6m\nBright Two-tone fitted kitchen with quartz stone countertops and breakfast counter. The kitchen includes a gas range cooker, integrated double oven, microwave, dishwasher, hob and extractor fan with space for fridge/freezer. Finished with a glass splashback, tiled flooring, two velux windows and glass French doors leading to the rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 2.2m x 3.4m\nSpacious utility room with fitted cabinets, sink, hotpress, space for dryer and plumped for washmachine. Finished with tiled flooring, a velux window and a glass door leading to the rear garden.\n\nGuest WC - 1.9m x 0.8m\nFully tiled guest WC featuring a wash hand basin with integrated storage cabinet and recess lighting.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - \nCarpet flooring and access to attic\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.3m x 2.9m\nGenerous double bedroom to the front featuring a large front-facing window, sliding wardrobes, TV point and finished with laminate effect timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.4m x 3.2m\nDouble bedroom to the rear with free standing wardrobes, and finished with laminate effect timber flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.2m x 1.7m\nGlass screen, laminate timber effect floor, currently set up as home office but could very easily be put back to the 3rd bedroom.\n\nShower Room - 2.1m x 1.7m\nFully tiled shower room featuring a corner electric rain shower, wash hand basin with integrated storage cabinet, and a heated towel rail. Finished with recess lighting.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront Garden - \nThe front entrance features a well maintained lawn with a gated side entrance.\n\nRear Garden - \nPrivate Sunny South facing walled rear garden featuring a well mainted decking area, lawn and flowerbeds. The garden benefits from a side entrance and direct access to the garage.\n\nGarage - 5.5m x 2.65m\nBlock built garage with flat roof and an up and over garage door to the outer courtyard.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li>uPVC Double Glazed windows </li><li>Large extension to rear</li><li>South facing rear garden </li><li>End of Terrace</li><li>Cul de Sac </li><li>Garage with direct access to rear garden</li><li>Utility Room & Guest wc</li><li>Modern Large Kitchen</li><li>Upgraded interior doors</li><li>Potential for 2 storey extension to side (*subj to PP) </li><li>Approx. 109sqm / 1,173sqft</ul>"
      },
